{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519190/extras/52f37fb33ac622b7eb43e7bc84aa621f.avif?t=1739162510\" width=800 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Stomping Grounds!  A silly multiplayer party brawler where your body is your only weapon.  Gain victory by hurling yourself at your enemies and laying waste to the level one ground-pound at a time.  But watch your step!  With fully destructible levels, no two stages are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family friendly and approachable, Stomping Grounds provides 2-button gameplay that is easy to pick up, and will provide hours of fun for up to 4 people.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REIGN VICTORIOUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your pick from a roster of feisty prehistoric champions and compete in a Quick Match or Tournament across 4 distinct modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519190/extras/c0cefe504c985cb2e68d51ae96c1e164.poster.avif?t=1739162510\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519190/extras/c0cefe504c985cb2e68d51ae96c1e164.webm?t=1739162510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519190/extras/c0cefe504c985cb2e68d51ae96c1e164.mp4?t=1739162510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAST STAND</strong> -\u00a0Anything goes in this classic elimination mode.\u00a0 Just be sure you\u2019re the last one standing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SMASH N GRAB</strong> -\u00a0Smash, grab and steal as many gems as you can carry - but watch the skies! Getting hit can be devastating.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOMB TAG</strong> -\u00a0Hold the bomb<strong> </strong>to rack up time, but get rid of it before it explodes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUMMIT RACE</strong> -\u00a0Put your speed to the test! Deliver the flag to stake your claim!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519190/extras/df424e2a236f230ae9d91e31c545e8c2.avif?t=1739162510\" width=616 height=467 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER UP YOUR STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique power-ups to gain the upper-hand.\u00a0 From Sure-Shot to Juggernaut, you're sure to send 'em packing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519190/extras/aa88f012ce87dde1679347ef15d47e49.poster.avif?t=1739162510\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519190/extras/aa88f012ce87dde1679347ef15d47e49.webm?t=1739162510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519190/extras/aa88f012ce87dde1679347ef15d47e49.mp4?t=1739162510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHARE YOUR CREATIVE SIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let loose creating the arena of your dreams in the fully featured level editor.\u00a0 It's never been easier to share your ideas with your frenemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519190/extras/813142271cd36c04d1bd5e2c1c2842b7.poster.avif?t=1739162510